the Saveable is a contract.
this allows Saved.
this allows Booming.

the Game is an actor.
this can Inner.
this's Inner does...
    that is Saveable.
    if input exists?
        this is Saved with "yes"!
    or?
        this is Booming!

this can Outer.
this's Outer does...
    that is Saveable.
    do this's Inner with input...
        when that is Saved?
            this is Saved with that!
        or?
            this is that!

the App is a script.

do Game's Outer with "x"...
    when that is Saved?
        log "saved " + that.
    or when that is Booming?
        log "booming".
    or?
        log "other".

do Game's Outer...
    when that is Saved?
        log "saved-no " + that.
    or when that is Booming?
        log "booming-no".
    or?
        log "other-no".
